 "title": "The leftover dissonance lives in whichever atom still acts as its line",
 "subject": "Where the genus-2 floor unit can sit in a knot sphere with two Fano atoms, as a function of the law's sign class",
 "conclusion": "On every genus-2 space tested, with two Fano atoms grown into a knot sphere, the floor unit can sit only inside an atom that acts as its line or at its junctions, decided by SAT over every state. Which atom holds the leftover dissonance is therefore set by the law's class, what was learned, and not by the state.",
